    register_option IVPN 'IVPN client' VPN off vpn_action 'Adds the official IVPN repository and installs ivpn-ui plus iptables-legacy. Requires a separately purchased IVPN account. Installing does not authenticate, connect or guarantee leak protection. Existing networking/firewall rules may interact with the client.'
    register_option MULLVAD 'Mullvad VPN client' VPN off vpn_action 'Adds the official Mullvad repository and installs mullvad-vpn. Requires a separately purchased account. Installing does not authenticate, connect or guarantee leak protection. Review compatibility with strict DNS and firewall changes.'
    # Disruptive actions run after all downloads, and are unavailable over SSH.
    register_option FIREWALL 'Firewalld default zone: DROP' Disruptive off setup_firewall_drop 'Installs/enables firewalld and changes its default zone to drop, blocking unsolicited inbound traffic for interfaces using that default. Explicitly assigned connection zones are unchanged. May break SSH, sharing and LAN discovery. Does not persist unrelated runtime rules. Local-console use only. Restore with sudo firewall-cmd --set-default-zone=FedoraWorkstation (or your previous zone).'
